  "description": "YITAMOTOR running boards are made of high-quality material, and we are very strict on quality control to make sure to serve superior service and auto parts to our customers.\nFitment\n2007-2018 Silverado 1500 Double Cab\n2007-2018 GMC Sierra 1500 Double Cab\n2007-2019 Silverado 2500HD 3500HD Double Cab\n2007-2019 GMC Sierra 2500HD 3500HD Double Cab\nFeatures\nPrecise Fit: YITAMOTOR side steps are specifically built for 2007-2018 Silverado/Sierra 1500, 07-19 2500HD 3500HD Extended/Double Cab; Confirm the product is compatible with your vehicle before purchase.\nPerformant Design: YITAMOTOR Running Boards features a drop-in design with a 4.7-inch wide surface, allowing you to comfortably step in and out of your vehicle. The surface has a 3D pattern, providing an excellent grip and slip resistance.\nDurable Steel: The pedal is made of high-quality steel, making it sturdy enough to carry up to 500lbs. The powder-coated surface ensures that the pedal will be rust-resistant and durable for an extended period, even with daily use. It is designed to withstand harsh weather conditions, which makes it ideal for outdoor and indoor use.\nTruck Protection: The nerf bars come with a car-side protective panel that reduces the impact of accidental collisions while providing a space for you to clean your boots. This feature ensures that your car remains scratch-free, making it an ideal addition to any car.\nEasy Installation: Step bar is an essential accessory for any vehicle owner who wants to make getting in and out of their car a more comfortable and safe experience.\nProfessional installation recommended",
